OL,3,GNEWSAFears train attack victim may
OL,4,A'stop breathing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedics feared a train staff member who
OL,7,Fused a frying pan to fend off a
OL,8,Fknifeman and suffered "catastrophic
OL,9,Fblood loss" was going to "stop
OL,10,Fbreathing", a court has heard.
OL,12,FSamir Zitouni was one of 10 people
OL,13,FAnthony Williams attacked on board a
OL,14,FDoncaster to London King's Cross
OL,15,Fservice which had to make an
OL,16,Funscheduled stop in Huntingdon,
OL,17,FCambridgeshire, on 1 November last
OL,18,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
