OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFears train attack victim may
OL,4,A'stop breathing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge Crown Court jurors heard both
OL,7,Fof Zitouni's lungs were punctured, that
OL,8,Fhe was in a life-threatening condition
OL,9,Fat the scene and admitted to intensive
OL,10,Fcare.
OL,12,FWilliams, 33, of Langford Road in
OL,13,FPeterborough, denies 10 counts of
OL,14,Fattempted murder.
